---
import { NINE_GRID } from '../consts';
---

<section class="nine-section" id="nine-grid" aria-labelledby="nine-title">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE INNER NINE · 九宮導覽</p>
    <h2 id="nine-title">選一格，走進今天的自己</h2>
    <p>每一種顏色都是一種心理能力；不是命運標籤，而是你此刻可以調用的理解方式。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="nine-grid">
    {
      NINE_GRID.map((cell) => (
        <a
          class={`nine-cell theme-${cell.theme}${cell.theme === 'core' ? ' is-core' : ''}`}
          href={cell.href}
          aria-label={`${cell.eyebrow}：${cell.name}`}
        >
          <span class="color-rail" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="cell-top">
            <span class="cell-label">{cell.eyebrow}</span>
            <span class="color-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </span>
          <span class="cell-copy">
            <strong>{cell.name}</strong>
            <span>{cell.description}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cell-index" aria-hidden="true">{cell.index}</span>
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="color-legend">
    <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    顏色 = 六種心理原型，滑過感受你的顏色
  </p>
</section>
